+## Overview
+The 30 orders generated total revenue of $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.95.
+
+## Top Products
+Gadget led revenue at $2,392.00, followed by Widget at $2,118.94, Doohickey at $1,513.00, and Sprocket at $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+North ranked first with $2,176.35, ahead of East ($1,830.79), South ($1,732.48), and West ($1,414.82).
+
+## Recommendations
+- Prioritize Gadget availability; it generated the highest product revenue at $2,392.00.
+- Study North's sales mix and apply relevant tactics elsewhere; North led regions with $2,176.35.
+- Target West for growth campaigns; its $1,414.82 revenue trailed every other region.
